            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><img src=\"93226e2d-9548-4ada-9486-9a7129abf988\" visible-if=\"always\" /><p>Bem-vindo! Nesta lição, você criará seu primeiro programa com JavaScript e o verá ganhar vida.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 151532,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Linguagens de programação como JavaScript permitem que você escreva programas que os computadores podem executar.</p><p>Clique no trecho de código <code>console.log(\"Hello, World\");</code> para adicioná-lo ao editor de código. Em seguida, clique no botão abaixo para executar o programa.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, World&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, World\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>console.log(\"Hello, World\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 151533,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os programas geralmente precisam memorizar informações. As variáveis tornam isso possível.</p><p>Adicione o trecho de código que armazena <code>\"Virginia\"</code> em uma variável chamada <code>firstName</code>. Depois, clique no botão abaixo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" firstName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const firstName = \"Virginia\";</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 151534,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agora o programa pode usar a variável <code>firstName</code>.</p><p>Adicione <code>firstName</code> à linha incompleta e execute o programa.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" firstName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", firstName);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Virginia\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>firstName</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 151535,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um programa pode executar várias instruções em ordem.</p><p>Use os trechos de código para formar <code>console.log(\"How are you?\");</code> no editor de código. Em seguida, clique no botão abaixo para ver o resultado.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" firstName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Virginia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello,&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", firstName);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;How are you?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Virginia\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"How are you?\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>console.log</code> seguido de <code>(</code> e depois <code>\"How are you?\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
